  "description": "The Mother Child Swing lets a parent and a toddler swing together. A Horizon Teal A-frame holds a yellow seat for the adult and a toddler seat facing it, so the two ride face to face. It is meant for the 2 to 4 years Key User Group, with capacity for two. The frame is 5'5\" x 7'6\" and needs a safe play area of 7'5\" x 12'9\". This is a thoughtful addition for a society garden or public park where parents bring very young children. Swinging face to face keeps the child close and calm. The galvanised frame carries a 3-year warranty, and bearings carry 1 year. Ask us how it fits next to your other play pieces.",
